{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical-scrolling 2D shooting game with three types of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapid Shot<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/2dc78ae24a3736c8a746fbe31172f972.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatling Laser<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/d6dc3e716cdadf823fed3188e7ca303e.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Burst<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/e9d0716fbd7e40d826fe9879925aa57a.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Gatling laser hits the target, a gauge is accumulated, and when it is accumulated to the maximum, the level is raised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the level increases, the number of simultaneous lock-ons increases, the speed of the laser increases, and the power of a laser decreases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When level 5 or higher is reached, full burst becomes available. <br>Press and hold Y to switch to full burst aiming and lock on up to 16 locks. <br>Release Y or wait a certain amount of time before firing a full burst. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a full burst lowers your level by 1, but increases the multiplier of the score item you get when you destroy an enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582270?t=1746526147","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/3db1e3b4c4717e06f79207ac33dfc48c6402fd08/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746526147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/46f4b5209d2af0818ed2cdf48d27a0f51a410b4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746526147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/46f4b5209d2af0818ed2cdf48d27a0f51a410b4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746526147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3603490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical-scrolling 2D shooting game with three types of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapid Shot<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/2dc78ae24a3736c8a746fbe31172f972.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatling Laser<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/d6dc3e716cdadf823fed3188e7ca303e.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Burst<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/extras/e9d0716fbd7e40d826fe9879925aa57a.avif?t=1746526147\" width=540 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Gatling laser hits the target, a gauge is accumulated, and when it is accumulated to the maximum, the level is raised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the level increases, the number of simultaneous lock-ons increases, the speed of the laser increases, and the power of a laser decreases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When level 5 or higher is reached, full burst becomes available. <br>Press and hold Y to switch to full burst aiming and lock on up to 16 locks. <br>Release Y or wait a certain amount of time before firing a full burst. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a full burst lowers your level by 1, but increases the multiplier of the score item you get when you destroy an enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SB_Games_Public"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582270/807024a660b09dd3aa62259a0613c8a5aa078a30/header.jpg?t=1746526147","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</st